# Evidence is kept byte for byte (SHA256SUMS): no line-ending normalisation here
# (the exported CSV ends its lines in CRLF, as the WebUI wrote it).
* -text
# The service log has lines ending in spaces (the launcher's banner, torch's
# capability warning): evidence, not style. The root .gitignore ignores *.log,
# so the two logs here were added with `git add -f`.
evidence/service.log whitespace=-blank-at-eol
# The CSV's CRLF line ends are what the WebUI wrote, not trailing space.
evidence/exports/*.csv whitespace=cr-at-eol
